## https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/blob/main/docs/keybindings.md
cliamp: (Playback) Play/Pause                                                                      | Spc
cliamp: (Playback) Stop                                                                          | s
cliamp: (Playback) Previous/Next track                                                           | </> / ,/.
cliamp: (Playback) Seek -/+5s                                                                    | Lt/Rt
cliamp: (Playback) Seek -/+30s (configurable)                                                    | S-Lt/Rt
cliamp: (Playback) Seek to N×10% of the track                                                    | $j
cliamp: (Playback) Volume up/down                                                                | +/-
cliamp: (Playback) Speed up/down (±0.25x)                                                        | ]/[
cliamp: (Playback) Toggle mono                                                                   | m
cliamp: (Playback) Jump to time                                                                  | C-j
cliamp (Navigation) Toggle focus (Playlist / EQ)                                                 | Tab
cliamp (Navigation) Playlist scroll / EQ band adjust (wraps around)                              | j/k / Up/Dn
cliamp (Navigation) Scroll playlist/file browser by page                                         | PgUp/PgDn / C-u/d
cliamp (Navigation) Go to top/end of playlist/file browser                                       | g/G / Home/End
cliamp (Navigation) Move track up/down in playlist/queue                                         | S-Up/Dn
cliamp (Navigation) EQ cursor left/right                                                         | h/l
cliamp (Navigation) Play selected track                                                          | Etr
cliamp (Navigation) Search playlist                                                              | /
cliamp (Navigation) Expand/collapse playlist                                                     | C-x
cliamp (Navigation) Open file browser                                                            | o
cliamp (Navigation) Back to provider                                                             | b/Esc
cliamp (EQ and Appearance) Cycle EQ preset                                                       | e
cliamp (EQ and Appearance) Choose theme                                                          | t
cliamp (EQ and Appearance) Cycle visualizer                                                      | v
cliamp (EQ and Appearance) Full screen visualizer                                                | V
cliamp (EQ and Appearance) Toggle album headers                                                  | C-h
cliamp (Features) Toggle bookmark ★ on selected track                                            | f
cliamp (Features) Search (In playlist/provider-browser views)                                    | C-f
cliamp (Features) Load URL (stream/playlist)                                                     | u
cliamp (Features) Show lyrics                                                                    | y
cliamp (Features) Save track to ~/Music                                                          | C-s
cliamp (Features) Navidrome browser                                                              | N
cliamp (Features) Browse local playlists (with cliamp radio)                                     | L
cliamp (Features) Open radio provider                                                            | R
cliamp (Features) Open Spotify provider                                                          | S
cliamp (Features) Open Plex provider                                                             | P
cliamp (Features) Open Jellyfin provider                                                         | J
cliamp (Features) Open Emby provider                                                             | E
cliamp (Features) Open YouTube provider                                                          | Y
cliamp (Features) Open SoundCloud provider                                                       | C
cliamp (Features) Open NetEase provider                                                          | M
cliamp (Playlist/Queue) Toggle queue (play next)                                                 | a
cliamp (Playlist/Queue) Queue manager                                                            | A
cliamp (Playlist/Queue) Remove the highlighted track from the current playlist                   | x
cliamp (Playlist/Queue) Playlist manager                                                         | p
cliamp (Playlist/Queue) Cycle repeat (Off/All/One)                                               | r
cliamp (Playlist/Queue) Toggle shuffle                                                           | z
cliamp (playlist manager) Move cursor                                                            | j/k / Up/Dn
cliamp (playlist manager) Filter (incremental)                                                   | /
cliamp (playlist manager) Clear filter                                                           | Esc
cliamp (playlist manager) List screen: open the highlighted playlist                             | Etr/Rt
cliamp (playlist manager) Tracks screen: play the highlighted track                              | Etr/Rt
cliamp (playlist manager) Tracks screen: play all from the top                                   | P
cliamp (playlist manager) Add the now-playing track (footer shows which track)                   | a
cliamp (playlist manager) List: delete playlist (confirms)                                       | d
cliamp (playlist manager) Tracks: remove the highlighted track                                   | d
cliamp (playlist manager) Tracks screen: go back to the list                                     | h/Bksp/Lt
cliamp (playlist manager) Close the playlist manager                                             | p/Esc
cliamp (Provider browser) Drill into a provider                                                  | N
cliamp (Provider browser) Move cursor (wraps top and bottom)                                     | j/k / Up/Dn
cliamp (Provider browser) Back/drill in                                                          | h/l / Lt/Rt
cliamp (Provider browser) Filter the visible list (search bar appears under the title)           | /
cliamp (Provider browser) Open (artists/albums)                                                  | Etr
cliamp (Provider browser) Play the highlighted track and queue the rest of the visible list      | Etr
cliamp (Provider browser) Replace the queue with all visible tracks (start from the top)         | R
cliamp (Provider browser) Append all visible tracks to the queue                                 | a
cliamp (Provider browser) Queue the highlighted track to play next                               | q
cliamp (Provider browser) Cycle album sort (album list only)                                     | s
cliamp (Provider browser) Quick-switch to that provider without going back through the main pane | S/N/P/J/E/Y/C/M/L/R
cliamp (Provider browser) Walk back one level / close the browser                                | b/Esc
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Move cursor (wraps)                                              | j/k / Up/Dn
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Load the highlighted playlist's tracks into the queue            | Etr
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Filter the playlist list                                         | /
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Online/server search                                             | C-f
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Refresh — re-pull the playlist list from the provider            | C-r
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Switch to that provider                                          | S/N/P/J/E/Y/C/M/L/R
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Switch focus to EQ                                               | Tab
cliamp (Provider playlist list) Back to the playlist pane                                        | b/Esc
cliamp (Search results overlays) Move cursor                                                     | j/k / Up/Dn
cliamp (Search results overlays) Play the selected track now                                     | Etr
cliamp (Search results overlays) Append the selected track to the playlist                       | a
cliamp (Search results overlays) Queue the selected track to play next                           | q
cliamp (Search results overlays) (Spotify only) Save the selected track to a Spotify playlist    | p
cliamp (Search results overlays) Back to the search input                                        | Bksp/Esc
cliamp (General) Show keymap                                                                     | C-k / ?
cliamp (General) Quit                                                                            | q